His name was Noren.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:13.120
Get this last name.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.080
Rad. Get it because he fucking surfs.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.400
That's rad as hell.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:18.700
That is pretty rad.

