00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:25.900
The tiny little line of pixels of your surfboard sticking out also counts as your sprite.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.400
But, like, it's very easy to kind of forget about that.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:35.840
